meta {
  name: 10 Portal (Plaid accounts)
  seq: 11
}

script:pre-request {
  // What the client sees over the accounts that "08 Plaid Linking" added. They need
  // those accounts, so without them they are skipped, not failed.
  if (!bru.getVar('plaidInvestedAccountId')) {
    bru.runner.skipRequest();
  }
}

docs {
  The portal's own views over the linked sandbox accounts, as staff see a client's
  portal (`as_client`). Run "08 Plaid Linking" first: it stores `plaidInvestedAccountId`
  (the 401(k)) and `plaidCashAccountId` (the checking account).

  Percentages in these responses are decimal fractions (0.05 is 5%).
}
